  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Montreal protocol 1999-12 - Import/Export Laos</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Montreal-prot 99-12</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bilaterala programmet under Montrealprotokollet. Ca 4 MSEK/&#xE5;r anvisas fr&#xE5;n UD f&#xF6;r att anv&#xE4;ndas f&#xF6;r projekt under MP(sen-97). Projekten m&#xE5;stegodk&#xE4;nnas av Montrealprotokollets Exekutiva innan pengarna kan anv&#xE4;ndaOm pengarna efter 3 &#xE5;r fortfarande inte anv&#xE4;nts ska de &#xE5;terbetalas tilMP Multilaterala Fond.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish bilateral programme under the Montreal Protocol, about 4 MSEK per year. The projects must be approved by the Executive Committee of the MP before the funds can be used. If the funds has not been used within 3 years the money must be transferred back to the Multilateral Fund of the MP.</narrative>
  </description>
